          </modifiers>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Unholy Vigor" id="6ae5-088c-b0f6-b5ff" hidden="false" page="0">
          <description>Whenever the Decimator suffers a Weapon Destroyed or Immobilized result, it can be ignored on a D6 roll of 5+
If the Decimator is wrecked (but not exploded), place it on its back, side or leave a marker on the table to represent its position. 

At the start of the controlling players subsequent turns, before movement, roll a D6. On a 6 the model returns to play (as close to the original location but 1&quot; away from an enemy) as though it has just Deep Struck in with all of its weapons and mobility restored and D3 Hull Points. On a 1, the Decimator is permamently wrecked.

On a roll of a 2-5, it remains wrecked but the controlling player may attempt to roll for Unholy Vigor on their next turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
