                <rule name="Hellish Demise" id="83f3-4bce-40c9-e868" hidden="false">
                  <description>when the rapier loses its last wound, roll as D6

1. Place a Large Blast on the table with the Rapier as the centre. All models under the template take a single Str 3 AP - hit with Soul Blaze. Remove the rapier as normal after this.

2-5. Is removed as normal

6. It explodes as it&apos;s a 1 result. In addition, a marker is placed where the rapier was, and any unit with Daemon that Deep Strikes within 6&quot; does not scatter.</description>
                </rule>
