        <rule name="Aerial Strike" id="df67-d9e4-0783-9be2" hidden="false">
          <description>In a Dogfight, a Heldrake which is tailing an opponent at a range of up to 12&quot; in the Attack sub-phase can make an Aerial Strike in addition to its other attacks. The Aerial Strike inflicts a S7 AP2 hit.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Meteroric Descent" id="59ce-8e8b-96d0-4adc" hidden="false" page="0">
          <description>Heldrake has the Vector Strike special rule while zooming. these hits are at S7</description>
