          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Vehicle gains the fear special rule. In addition, when psychic tests to use Maelific powers are made by friendly psykers within 12&quot;, one D6 may be re-rolled for every Hull Point remaining.   If the test is failed, the vehicle suffers a penetrating hit in addition to the normal psyker consquences.</characteristic>
