          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the beginning of each of the bearers turns, the bearer may choose to gain an extra power for the rest of the game.  Roll a D6 (and consult the chart in Codex:CSM under its profile) and then randomly generate a power from the selected discipline.  Each time the bearer uses the scrolls (including re-rolls), it must take a Str 3, AP,1 Ignores Cover hit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
