          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of any of your Movement phases, you can choose to roll 3D6 and move the bearer and his unit up to the distance rolled in inches instead of moving normally. You can do this even if they are locked in combat; if you do so, enemy units cannot Consolidate.</characteristic>
