      <rules>
        <rule name="Achean Force" id="e0c3-d668-336d-f018" hidden="false">
          <description>Any Psyker that has one or more weapons with this special rule knows the Achean Force psychic power in addition to any other powers they know.


Achean Force - Warp Charge 1
Force is a blessing psychic power that targets the Psyker and his unit. All of the targets&apos; weapons that have the Achean Force special rule gain +2 Str until the start of your next Psychic phase.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
